  "name": "artifact-release-provenance-ledger",
  "title": "Record non-runtime artifact provenance at DONE without CLI semver noise",
  "description": "DONE currently skips the CLI patch version when a story changes only non-runtime artifacts such as experiment protocol outputs. That skip is correct for CLI/runtime semver, but users still need a durable provenance/version record for delivered non-runtime artifacts.",
